.com/dlang/dub/pull/3104\r\n* Fix #3081: ignore $ROOT_PACKAGE_DIR in source/import path warning by @hariprakazz in https://github.com/dlang/dub/pull/3102\r\n* update version to v1.42.0-beta.1 by @ibuclaw in https://github.com/dlang/dub/pull/3105\r\n* promote aarch64, add link to keep docs consistent by @WebFreak001 in https://github.com/dlang/dub/pull/3078\r\n* Fix #3109: Fix generated temporary file name by @s-ludwig in https://github.com/dlang/dub/pull/3110\r\n* Fixes #3080--Filter some Dflags to propagated downward by @gulugulubing in https://github.com/dlang/dub/pull/3111\r\n* Ninja backend by @hariprakazz in https://github.com/dlang/dub/pull/3124\r\n* Fix -conf flag not being passed to linker by @LunaTheFoxgirl in https://github.com/dlang/dub/pull/3125\r\n* fix visuald generator to use selected compiler instead of hardcoded dmd by @kmr-ankitt in https://github.com/dlang/dub/pull/3094\r\n* feat: add ar rule and static library support to ninja generator by @hariprakazz in https://github.com/dlang/dub/pull/3132\r\n* feat: handle sub-packages in ninja generator by @hariprakazz in https://github.com/dlang/dub/pull/3133\r\n* Fix Windows response file quoting for trailing backslashes by @niy-ati in https://github.com/dlang/dub/pull/3135\r\n* feat: regenerate build.ninja when dub.json or dub.selections.json change by @hariprakazz in https://github.com/dlang/dub/pull/3134\r\n* fix: emit -J flags for stringImportPaths and add behavioral makedeps test by @hariprakazz in https://github.com/dlang/dub/pull/3141\r\n* commandline: add ninja to generate help text by @hariprakazz in https://github.com/dlang/dub/pull/3143\r\n* purge changelog by @dkorpel in https://github.com/dlang/dub/pull/3145\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @hariprakazz made their first contribution in https://github.com/dlang/dub/pull/3093\r\n* @kmr-ankitt made their first contribution in https://github.com/dlang/dub/pull/3097\r\n* @gulugulubing made their first contribution in https://github.com/dlang/dub/pull/3111\r\n* @niy-ati made their first contribution in https://github.com/dlang/dub/pull/3135\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/dlang/dub/compare/v1.41.0...v1.43.0","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dlang/dub/releases/434949491/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":11}